#: src/dialer-window.c
msgid ""
"That a call is being recorded is said by a <a href=\"https://github.com/"
"rhasspy/piper\">Piper</a> voice (MIT License) from <a href=\"https://"
"huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices\">rhasspy/piper-voices</a>. The voices' "
"recordings: Cori Samuel's for LibriVox (English), public domain; Thorsten-"
"Voice (German), Davefx (Spanish), Paola (Italian), Pim (Dutch) and Denis "
"(Russian), CC0; the SIWIS French Speech Synthesis Database (French), <a "
"href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\">CC BY 4.0</a>. The "
"French and Italian voices are trained from the Hi-Fi TTS voice of Cori "
"Samuel (NVIDIA, CC BY 4.0)."
msgstr ""
"Dat een gesprek wordt opgenomen, zegt een <a href=\"https://github.com/"
"rhasspy/piper\">Piper</a>-stem (MIT-licentie) uit <a href=\"https://"
"huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices\">rhasspy/piper-voices</a>. De opnamen "
"van de stemmen: die van Cori Samuel voor LibriVox (Engels), publiek domein; "
"Thorsten-Voice (Duits), Davefx (Spaans), Paola (Italiaans), Pim (Nederlands) "
"en Denis (Russisch), CC0; de SIWIS French Speech Synthesis Database (Frans), "
"<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\">CC BY 4.0</a>. De "
"Franse en de Italiaanse stem zijn getraind op de stem van Cori Samuel uit Hi-"
"Fi TTS (NVIDIA, CC BY 4.0)."

